{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa3.u09",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa3.u09",
  "version": 1,
  "content_hash": "9cd35e115d495133a1e7abb16b18e61208ffdca0111a7d3c3f5ce12b07ac9e6a",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa3.u09.l01",
      "sha256": "27d8ea2079dda65528cd376ea9a51a484ebb214f44884a8d8f96c01e9272f89d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa3.u09.l02",
      "sha256": "8e5bf8479e157783200e5f1c6a0ae258fab126eca5e4bae75047bd5f1f171e0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa3.u09.l03",
      "sha256": "fd6f5cda239d22d8c0bc9d515b569322f3ad9830f7ebb00908bf006d581fd35e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa3.u09.l04",
      "sha256": "09c1c56db0cfab48c55f1570cea64cae796ec33e28f5f4991b3c42fe16e63f03"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa3.u09.l05",
      "sha256": "b7d0e6ad36a0833bf8aa8f4f4c5bff1df509509c7e71b6af32f9ef6f82344a0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa3.u09.l06",
      "sha256": "3b363ce60721a286b92a2808a5ccbeb44d2ab2dfdffa30a668ab8382b8641931"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "001b63666b04bb0dc6c558ea42aa8fade5a5a699bec2cd8e37de0081c37914a1",
      "text": "Dia tidak memilih. Kalau dia memilih satu pangeran, yang lain akan marah.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "031b0d21fe54be7cfffd735cb9483b9a4e324458c4a8de7d1c0d3a22b33eea49",
      "text": "Lalu?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0974cdf5b1dd4cb5d7695750e078541e884eda86d0fd621c696fda1ad607bd6f",
      "text": "Putri yang baik sayang kepada rakyatnya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a52dd5872933a75c1c8c32fe3f4a4035a4db092ec401556e43356705fb8f2e1",
      "text": "Si Kancil sangat ___. Dia selalu punya ide.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c2e4b10f7b8142acf8f9b7b5fae6d07c2105a1e0e75dad8e7156361525695d0",
      "text": "rakyat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d81755acd29c759a5b04931e7b31c5f0b935e4249eb18d45955b05f3954b147",
      "text": "Lalu “Suatu hari …”, ada masalah. Akhirnya, masalah itu selesai.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0e4a3fab46d30a5f0c5d25f688f2954b3742c2348021a4749f83398f85687793",
      "text": "Kancil itu kecil, tetapi cerdik. Dia lebih pintar daripada buaya!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f7bf2279291b4fd0ca00f34a5f38ad4e19803fa77ad806544d7c947e4a69e47",
      "text": "menuntun",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "102833fd2682dea14fa5ebe673322941bf0d17488baf4d0897c3c73fc0566477",
      "text": "buaya",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "10a34de152820e85ef8185fe024827e5be6b668e8b141b227c8f458ea84e3766",
      "text": "menunggang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "117f2f17b26f5ff1916dd2e18aa770dd29ecc3661e8314cc8eb12eae3ccf3829",
      "text": "zaman",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "17898e1f1bd385bdf29be94822440806678bab7ebbf3a33fae901d0439becb52",
      "text": "istana",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1fcb9354973614f67c893b666b332972666b0d1cd3a10cccbcf770fdd88504cb",
      "text": "Aduh, sedih sekali!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 19,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2568b0ed1c27b5d91cb4252d99c40a27da44c8eec30187afb0df7275a8848c19",
      "text": "Suatu hari, putri itu pergi ke pantai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 38,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "26b78fb9dee1eb5063b9a8f5ac7fb41380163846bae413cfce85f3901647291f",
      "text": "Putri Mandalika berpikir berhari-hari, lalu terjun ke laut.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "287f42facd4d51793f8e443c77ab3a6aeca2a92ddb94263970bb67e530835fa0",
      "text": "Mas, saya mau menulis dongeng. Mulainya bagaimana?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2a278366a6e10d1020c95ee7a16b39b5cb7e8c3e0d35b51c6078716c2e7b3cfb",
      "text": "Mohamed, kamu sudah dengar legenda Putri Mandalika?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2beabbd36881151c64e9b956b9034e01e21651af82d68d166c5eea645d181c72",
      "text": "berbondong-bondong",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 18,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2d6639d81322dfc4cdc3f18d04848818190290af4191d704ca827471dab44ea8",
      "text": "Pada hari Lebaran, kami ___.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 28,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2e1d152a5e1abf4fd3201989b4867598e998a2ad876561a66d3f3fa091d366c1",
      "text": "Mau! Di Indonesia kami punya cerita Abu Nawas.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3140820a06d5baf5ec6c5f83ee66d5263071307c560ae313b4ca203039463832",
      "text": "Si Kancil? Siapa itu?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 21,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "32af30a91004789a00fef83c82011664ee1280c3ebb791439e86749aa76da143",
      "text": "kancil",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3455eac2ca2ff8b7eaf2c5daa0a0b209cf3de356a1e37e8a15b71dc4ef1b7db0",
      "text": "Setelah salat Id, semua orang bersalam-salaman.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "38cff3e56baae0a3ced36ec4b92128dbc2f30140b923e01462018a5b4735254a",
      "text": "___, hiduplah seorang raja yang sombong.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "393d1bc3d6764170e7c55329bc7e3f01312ebec15ad4c52ea965805f477c2b2f",
      "text": "berlari-larian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "39792e0cfa83201b4e4c69645f45e840d21a9f1974079bea0b10eb3cd86886ce",
      "text": "Putri Mandalika terjun ke laut.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 31,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3a2f082b954c89527f6d353aea2583c168e694de3654f6e635830decab09d018",
      "text": "Ya. Nanti malam saya mau bercerita tentang Si Kancil untuk mereka.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3e021914611f9ba70ed7c3d25f5244624960e517718977a6a2da9d6d360e3eb5",
      "text": "berkejar-kejaran",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 16,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "44827cc0040c6585842c4c435408f28cbfdf90926a7c8c3d59be9a351a04454d",
      "text": "Putri Mandalika berpikir berhari-hari.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 38,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "45c1523940b86d7a2e1ac850a5009e057ae8d5270a08cf1c9c6c795d9250bb05",
      "text": "keledai",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "46a53b73326aa97cb2feda5cd83f4f5fa1b6a2e3da177cf0f43ca9418e11db3c",
      "text": "Lalu?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "49019ef6f93ee2997b7d6ffba434227c0ef97fd8173c9c10f61cf32a26a11bed",
      "text": "Anak-anak berlari-larian di pantai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 35,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "511c907f75dfdc14417aa45684ac8c0c5c8a03cfcc7f546d721be98cc38cd272",
      "text": "hiduplah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "539dbb6059c94bc2e53fec0a50c69dc512ee6e30484b82a83023044155fe5177",
      "text": "Amanat cerita ini adalah jangan sombong.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5595f2638e628da99bbbb2fdb8ad99e6e9046aecb95077297585a548056ec45c",
      "text": "Setiap tahun, warga datang berbondong-bondong ke pantai untuk mencari nyale.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5617b157727a224e12f9bd68e87fbd24a761f6944ad42af0477dec6da1b51a0d",
      "text": "suatu hari",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "59d27bd0da0aa467e7015ea817ec54616bb61085ecd8243d3f0c2dac0a4ea966",
      "text": "Dia terjun ke laut. Sekarang warga datang berbondong-bondong untuk mencari nyale.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 81,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5a731d716ba39736e53145311c239deb370baed3add53b834704b84748989346",
      "text": "Si Kancil berkejar-kejaran dengan buaya di sungai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6204f6d092cda9bc7cbe5c44d58d72043723671d2b6d3cc511e449f25332b73d",
      "text": "Mas, di Mesir ada dongeng tentang Juha. Mau dengar?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "623316b05639737ffa8eb5277bfd8255372c3ab30e20be7c43cd8c14a7b8a84b",
      "text": "Sudah! Para pangeran menunggu berhari-hari, tetapi putri itu tidak memilih.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "65f805ffcca1ec9c39d4916466d0fd6fa14b369b092827b5a8e106890ec2aeda",
      "text": "amanat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "69ea75cde357a4e8e5681621a8b4652ab9e0e5d636750764b5f16df50073f0f4",
      "text": "Jangan lupa amanatnya. Misalnya, jangan sombong!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "69ee290fee8d760db5eb9886b313693f367950350b695c7fb2c3ff88a1b222fd",
      "text": "Lihat, anak-anak berlari-larian di Pantai Pink!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6c13fc51369b8eb9adc40c5b95eb2d60900d4b3da1c66d08104cdfb4a1da4719",
      "text": "Anak-anak berkejar-kejaran di Pantai Pink.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6d611320b0f4e86804dfaa0ce195c642a4ac8491ab77930006621e226b52d3ed",
      "text": "cerdik",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7378f384a596961cd6240cac23a875da460a5045de21c042ec5b388f8862c405",
      "text": "terjun",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "744aef0571ecdcb258167557facd1b5a6eaf170970f175765687a5a84795798d",
      "text": "Kami menunggu kapal ___ di pelabuhan. Lama sekali!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "74a6dd66702612f5f9eb30668c3a84254cbc4b8e2d02121634fdc0ed3ef3c3ba",
      "text": "Juha ___ keledai, dan anaknya berjalan kaki.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "74d94f7b8390cbe8796b1005260cadfdbb3ebf7db519a9410813d58ede018a3b",
      "text": "Buaya-buaya datang berbondong-bondong.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 38,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "758890b9619cf757621f966b8faf0cb8d07950425d99af0961c59776402de922",
      "text": "berhari-hari",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "75931b15c32965b0800099378709ae589739eabf3cb5cc67d3eb69877b6016dd",
      "text": "Pada zaman dahulu, hiduplah seorang laki-laki bernama Juha.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "79aded4682439d5cdf74df3b1b16a159a2f4c384c4e93449612450e7d60160c5",
      "text": "Si Kancil kecil, tetapi cerdik.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 31,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7a0737d8576477af4d47966f1de1d535a008c8aec543de9008e710d21e00bbb3",
      "text": "Orang-orang di pasar menertawakan Juha.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7a2fa302bc8ea0eed687c6fe713e179377e8e023895b5ca1f3fa3aa25840cf5d",
      "text": "pangeran",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7a34a649a89edc765fefc70749e0f392dce9a064ab196e5c3c48a24f421fc6b2",
      "text": "Setelah salat Id, semua orang ___.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 34,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "804ceb1e293ed386b05ef05d42eedff5f2fa37d77033951d15fba6b05dd0ff13",
      "text": "berjam-jam",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "828d0c841008e56e4d4aae58c26ee90c9038027cfc4b9059ed79c0259746c7b9",
      "text": "menertawakan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8ae71ea95a99f09e4fec9f07ba7f0824e301f967a2169634eb8556cf1b61ef1a",
      "text": "Akhirnya, mereka berdua menuntun keledai itu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8b184a97574ebb4a1d191f29d5a241f679959a2179801862c59e48e175c5f087",
      "text": "Si Kancil ___, jadi buaya tidak bisa menangkapnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8c979893586fe4f15b3cedba61f63ca2fc310b9789af8ce85cf9b4d098a88153",
      "text": "Juha dan anaknya menunggang keledai berdua.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "95491eba657910bcfaac1e79cb502b483d8ee56603f56f66d75c24201879f506",
      "text": "Pada hari Lebaran, kami bermaaf-maafan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9b8a4d42828f0ff6c5a8c5b275f6c5bda563a9bb0e5d68238377bc3f76c32e70",
      "text": "Akhirnya, mereka berdua menuntun keledai itu. Orang-orang menertawakan mereka!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9e5c28cda30353660985eb7729d96c4cb9de9ba4751ceb88f21e6c0d508b99e5",
      "text": "Lalu mereka berdua menunggang keledai. Orang-orang bilang, “Kasihan keledainya!”",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a1e4705777194e9a3c693685e7da1a2208d8cf3227413e42a9a1fe967fee01f7",
      "text": "Kancil yang cerdik ingin menyeberang sungai.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a317a18293feeb18d929a969501b59f676e8ae03f33597e003f5537a2092418c",
      "text": "Akhirnya, raja itu tidak sombong lagi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 38,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a8aa4a5e460169b545af00b91b59d81b4853fe0a107487d290fe1c69493804ef",
      "text": "Para pangeran menunggu berjam-jam di istana.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b4a86440ee5962661eb6be688792bd4d6d9674bd16f74cae5673b459c9c7cc7f",
      "text": "Sekarang, setiap tahun warga datang berbondong-bondong untuk mencari nyale.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b561ad78387aaa94c1fc12d596b392d133103513ba268c861af269b65f8b7dcf",
      "text": "Dulu, banyak pangeran datang ke istana. Mereka menunggu berhari-hari karena semua ingin menikah dengan putri itu.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 113,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b64041a8591441d9cb3d3a8173d9421153dba02eae660a8a895a31de05cb4a03",
      "text": "Mulai dengan “Pada zaman dahulu, hiduplah …”.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b7c83a5e52d0563a9ccea7d34c47e6fb18f47f6bd8a876954181b19d22747610",
      "text": "Raja itu ___. Dia merasa paling hebat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 38,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b9b3919dd98c02cb85bb0080ca652288da771b6c4d22d87ca9976706ed31e022",
      "text": "sombong",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ba3b5ac73cdf111faf208cc85db4ff4edcc94b336ae1ce428d7e8a92e30ff696",
      "text": "Jadi, dia pergi ke pantai dan terjun ke laut.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bd81f37a8657398175c1dfd070700c8c88f538d863e39da526400b90ce15e740",
      "text": "Rakyat percaya nyale adalah Putri Mandalika.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c8107ff554639e3c55657841deb37e34794e04edd12c883dc18776a3e67b3e53",
      "text": "raja",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "caa598cbd0251707d7d8dccd1952306e8bad45f1df4e820f4638dc73db7b4854",
      "text": "Suatu hari, datang seorang anak yang cerdik.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cc5f5d3da25eb6edbf10d0a121511a2ac139630fadfe4d4a86a5414bc73d8012",
      "text": "nyale",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cf61f9a3159f579a51530e9afae83f9e2c8ecffb2fbc0dc33ab834d0ffcb639f",
      "text": "Dua anak berkejar-kejaran di Pantai Pink.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d2d8aa198778fdde9308be6c009178356d5df33ee63c97e9810306f368eb53b9",
      "text": "Suatu hari, Juha menunggang keledai, dan anaknya berjalan kaki. Orang-orang bilang, “Kasihan anaknya!”",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 102,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d2f6c3e497c0eca435f532c6d41802da6c55e99e27bc829a180d4b9e091da317",
      "text": "Pada zaman dahulu, hiduplah seorang raja yang sombong.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d4bba25eed20c197d08dfccd5328e148a873b03f6793307fb377ee2f452e4e5c",
      "text": "Mas, ceritakan tentang Putri Mandalika, dong!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d889d9ffb0de1745a51308fbde64c135986754ffeadf250212be01bb4c095a3c",
      "text": "Wah! Lalu putri itu memilih siapa?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 34,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dfc8f69c17d29b1e6ba9872a52a5c15d3c4a2d8c1f235a4c7be55587cd8419b8",
      "text": "Pada zaman dahulu, para pangeran menunggu berhari-hari di istana.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e22ae60451fcd605993e5c9f7fe6085eb71e4bc94a7c46082acb40bf5c1587ed",
      "text": "bertahun-tahun",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e3226bada8f41c81c55192501dc97c00cf22f841b04bc0994f90942daebbac77",
      "text": "Lalu banyak nyale datang ke pantai. Rakyat percaya nyale itu adalah Putri Mandalika.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 84,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e3b462e65bb942a690c0e3ffdf28308ef123d67f7b1d7f80663067154da7d60b",
      "text": "Itu cerita untuk besok!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 23,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e71714f8c06673b9551d843bacd4e5b287f2012eab6cd9ada50cc87efb044c10",
      "text": "Menurutmu, apa amanatnya?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 25,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e775365c983010708429ffa3fb2fc6bdd900ffaaa0bfcbc87dc9cfedc317a619",
      "text": "Para pangeran datang ke istana untuk ___ Putri Mandalika.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e8c986af29c7919a50fb9f6f26231c19552d061a83c743559d10a657df58d5a1",
      "text": "Mas, sekarang ceritakan akhirnya! Putri Mandalika memilih siapa?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fae3792714c13773a024991e51d0706659a172350e5b811c3ad54cf1629255d4",
      "text": "bermaaf-maafan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fb0249425a2099bc637a20c42cc5e681f661ee0f4bc141d347a634843097cbbf",
      "text": "melamar",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fc42ff7a792740669957d9bff2544e0ca3fa1c994a07bde729ac77b40c032587",
      "text": "Ha-ha! Amanatnya, kita tidak bisa menyenangkan semua orang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fc55fa03d39d40e532faf42fd7953cfcf35d6e768272faa811885184f5012d69",
      "text": "Orang-orang menertawakan Juha dan keledainya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    }
  ],
